# vman_ml/resources/ bundles the real WHO instrument workbooks - the three
# whova_*_instr_*.xlsx files are package resources loaded by
# instrument_dictionary.py's WORKBOOKS at runtime (2016_tz/2022_tz/2022_es);
# who_va_instr_mapping.csv is vman_dq's ICI hand-verification audit trail
# (referenced from vman3_dq's README.md / dqa.py docstring), not code-loaded
# by anything. The blanket *.xlsx/*.csv rules above would otherwise silently
# strip all of these from every push - who_va_instr_mapping is CSV (plain
# flat sheet); the rest stay xlsx (linked survey/choices/settings sheets).
!vman_ml/resources/who_va_instr_mapping.csv
!vman_ml/resources/whova_2016_instr_tz.xlsx
!vman_ml/resources/whova_2022_instr_es.xlsx
!vman_ml/resources/whova_2022_instr_tz.xlsx

